findings.claim:
The below scenes really contain no hidden object and no hidden lamp. The only lamps are the 24 LED faces, at 0 W, visible to the camera and inside the fitting. The 'NOT ZERO' line is the runner's false alarm. An even white sky with the studio and room removed is an honest technical light under the house rule:
- nothing hidden stands in frame;
- every mesh casts shadows;
- there is no sun, only the sky's own light;
- the paper floor below is real and lit by the same sky.
Two conditions: the white has to read white (F2), and the label should say the studio lamps are off.
